    featuredImagePrompt: "A conceptual visual representing global geopolitical tension and diplomatic confrontation. Abstract elements symbolize Iran, the U.S., and Israel as distinct, yet interconnected, forces at a global forum. Use a muted but dramatic color palette with reds, greys, and deep blues. Overlapping, angular lines and geometric shapes converge towards a central, glowing, fragmented sphere suggesting the UN or global unity under strain. Include subtle, blurred suggestions of flags or national symbols within the abstract forms without explicit representation. The composition should convey a sense of 'defiance' and 'accusation' through visual metaphor, avoiding any human figures or specific architectural details. The overall mood is tense, complex, and high-stakes.",
