    featuredImagePrompt: "A clean, modern infographic-style visual presenting data on India's cricket dominance. The central element is a stylized world map with India prominently highlighted and glowing, perhaps with a subtle overlay of cricket stumps or a trophy silhouette. Around India, abstract data visualizations radiate outwards: a line graph showing India's consistent rise in cricket rankings over the last decade compared to other major cricketing nations (e.g., Australia, England depicted with lower trajectories), a pie chart illustrating India's disproportionately large share of global cricket revenue, and smaller icons representing fan engagement metrics. The color palette should be vibrant but professional, using shades of blue, green, and gold, avoiding any celebratory crowd imagery due to sensitive context.",
