    featuredImagePrompt: "A conceptual visual representing the global sports business. On one side, vibrant, dynamic elements of cricket (a T20 World Cup trophy, cricket bat, ball, stylized stadium lights in India). On the other side, equally dynamic elements of football (a Saudi Pro League logo, a football, a stadium with a superstar player silhouette, elements suggesting global reach). These two halves are intertwined and subtly battling, with digital data streams and abstract financial graphs flowing between them, symbolizing the commercial competition and fan engagement. The overall feel should be modern, energetic, and convey a sense of a shifting, interconnected global economy, rather than a literal photographic scene. Focus on abstract shapes and glowing lines to connect the elements, with a subtle map overlay in the background highlighting key regions like India, Europe, and the Middle East.",
