      probabilityWeightedOutlook: "Medium-High Risk, Medium Reward. The probability of significant upside is balanced by the high probability of further volatility and potential losses. A successful execution requires sustained Bitcoin price stability or appreciation, which is inherently unpredictable. The Q3 loss already indicates the challenges.",
      potentialCatalysts: ["Significant appreciation in Bitcoin\'s price post-vote.", "Positive shareholder approval and clear communication of risk management.", "H100 demonstrating successful, profitable crypto asset management.", "Broader institutional adoption of Bitcoin as a treasury asset."],
