      neutralCase: "These incidents are significant but represent a continuous challenge in a rapidly evolving technological landscape. While concerning, the industry\'s response mechanisms, including compensation pledges and enhanced security measures post-incident, reflect a maturing ecosystem. The hacks serve as a catalyst for improved security protocols and increased regulatory clarity, which, in the long run, could strengthen the overall integrity and safety of the digital asset market, balancing innovation with necessary risk mitigation.",
