      bullCase: "The increasing integration of blockchain by major financial institutions like DBS and JPMorgan, coupled with sustained investment from large endowments in Bitcoin ETFs, signals a deepening institutional embrace. This foundational shift, alongside the potential for regulatory clarity in key markets, could drive significant long-term capital inflows, enhancing market stability and overall valuation for digital assets.",
