      probabilityWeightedOutlook: "There\'s a moderate-to-high probability (60%) of continued, albeit gradual, institutional integration and capital inflows, particularly in tokenized assets and Bitcoin ETFs. A 30% probability exists for significant volatility driven by macro factors and regulatory shifts, potentially leading to short-term corrections. A 10% chance of accelerated growth due to unforeseen positive catalysts or rapid regulatory clarity. Overall, a cautiously optimistic outlook with an emphasis on long-term structural growth.",
